# Voice Provider principle

Canonical: `docs/ai/VOICE-AGENT-ARCHITECTURE.md`

- **ElevenLabs** = initial **Voice Provider** (Live). Not the DigitalGate intelligence layer.
- **DigitalGate** owns Business Brain, Model Router, tools, CRM, Opportunity Intelligence, permissions, audit.
- Persist `provider` on every `CommunicationAgent` (`elevenlabs` | `openai_voice` | …).
- Customer position: **AI employees connected to your business** — not “ElevenLabs voice agents inside DigitalGate.”
- Do not hard-wire architecture to a single voice vendor; OpenAI Realtime is Direction behind the same adapter.
